# prebuilt bytes that enter the SIGNED image but are not built here: the
# systemd EFI stub, cut from ONE arch package fetched by name from the arch
# linux archive -- the frozen archive the repro toolchain is pinned to --
# never from whatever the build host has installed, so a host upgrade can
# neither move the signed bytes nor halt the build. ONE digest per line: the
# package, then each member blob() cuts from it. regenerate with
# ./build.sh blobpin <pkgver>; blob() fetches + verifies both, blobver()
# re-checks before uki() wraps anything, and G58 checks that it still does.
# pinning fixes the bytes and names them in a diff; it does not make them
# trustworthy. see trust.manifest.
